# Weapon comparison scenario: full thrust from the countdown, then one fire press.
#
# Both sides hold thrust through the countdown (not a false start, see
# docs/gameplay/race-modes.md#the-countdown-is-measured) and fire when the craft
# is in the same state: the emulator side, scripts/psp-weapon-pair.py, ORs the
# fire bit in 120 frames after the player's throttle word first goes non-zero,
# which measured speed 106.2 at x 124.5 on Talon's Junction (Time Trial, Venom,
# Assegai). Ours reaches that state on tick 403, about ten ticks after the same
# 120 frames, because our standing start is that much slower off the line
# (a handling matter, not this scenario's). Combine with `oag-game --give <weapon>`.
# 2026-10-08: stale for a matched pair. Our standing start now reaches that state on
# tick 393; see weapon-after-go-matched.inputs. Kept for the tests that pin to it.
